data.routing_prompt:
Classify this invoice into a risk tier based on the following criteria:
- 'high_risk': total_amount > 10000 OR vendor is new (not in vendor_record OR vendor_record.status != 'approved') OR vendor risk_tier = 'high'
- 'standard': everything else

Invoice total: {{ state.extracted_invoice.total_amount }}
Vendor record: {{ state.vendor_record | tojson }}

Return ONLY the route name: 'high_risk' or 'standard'.

data.context_template:
⚠️ High-Risk Invoice Requires Approval

Invoice ID: {{ state.invoice_id }}
Vendor: {{ state.extracted_invoice.vendor_name }}
Amount: {{ state.extracted_invoice.currency }} {{ state.extracted_invoice.total_amount }}
Risk Level: {{ state.risk_level }}
Vendor Status: {{ state.vendor_record.status if state.vendor_record else 'UNKNOWN - Not in registry' }}

Line Items:
{% for item in state.extracted_invoice.line_items %}
  - {{ item.description }}: {{ item.quantity }} × {{ item.unit_price }} = {{ item.total }}
{% endfor %}

Please review all checklist items before approving.

data.user_prompt:
Generate a brief approval notice for this standard-risk invoice:
Vendor: {{ state.extracted_invoice.vendor_name }}
Amount: {{ state.extracted_invoice.total_amount }} {{ state.extracted_invoice.currency }}
Date: {{ state.extracted_invoice.invoice_date }}

Generate a procurement decision report:

Invoice ID: {{ state.invoice_id }}
Vendor: {{ state.extracted_invoice.vendor_name }}
Amount: {{ state.extracted_invoice.currency }} {{ state.extracted_invoice.total_amount }}
Risk Level: {{ state.risk_level }}
Decision: {{ 'APPROVED' if state.approval_decision else 'REJECTED' }}
Feedback: {{ state.approval_feedback }}
Submitted by: {{ state.submitted_by }}
Date: today

Include: Executive Summary, Risk Assessment, Decision Rationale, Next Steps.
